"guide.header-title" = "How-to Tutorial";
"guide.introduction.flow-body" = "1  Review the initial account\n2  Choose its storage\n3  Sign in if needed\n4  Launch each profile from the account list\n\n";
"guide.introduction.flow-heading" = "Overview\n";
"guide.introduction.prerequisite-body" = "If an existing environment is found, the first account is registered automatically using its email address as the display name. If no existing environment is found, or when adding a second account, choose the storage after adding the account. Projects and chats are never copied between accounts.";
"guide.introduction.prerequisite-heading" = "Before You Begin\n";
"guide.introduction.summary" = "ChatGPT Profile Manager gives each ChatGPT account a separate storage location and lets those profiles run at the same time. It does not move or copy accounts or cloud projects.\n\n";
"guide.introduction.title" = "Welcome";
"guide.mechanism.launch-body" = "The existing environment launches with ChatGPT’s default storage. Each isolated instance receives its own storage paths through environment variables and an argument. ChatGPT Profile Manager does not copy or move data; it selects a separate location for each running instance.\n\n";
"guide.mechanism.launch-heading" = "How Storage Is Selected at Launch\n";
"guide.mechanism.location-heading" = "Storage Location\n";
"guide.mechanism.location-tree" = "~/Library/Application Support/\n└── ChatGPT Profile Manager/\n    └── Profiles/\n        └── account-<display-name>-<short-ID>/\n            ├── CodexHome/\n            └── ElectronUserData/";
"guide.mechanism.paths-body" = "CODEX_HOME stores Codex settings, authentication, sessions, logs, and related data. CODEX_ELECTRON_USER_DATA_PATH and --user-data-dir select where the ChatGPT desktop app stores cookies, login state, and app data. Pointing both locations into the same isolated profile keeps each account’s environment separate.\n\n";
"guide.mechanism.paths-heading" = "What Each Location Stores\n";
"guide.mechanism.storage-body" = "The existing ChatGPT environment is the storage ChatGPT normally uses. An isolated profile is dedicated storage that ChatGPT Profile Manager prepares for one account. Login state and app data stay separate for each account.\n\n";
"guide.mechanism.storage-heading" = "Two Types of Storage\n";
"guide.mechanism.title" = "How It Works and Where Data Is Stored";
"guide.mechanism.usage-body" = "The account list shows the plan name when available. 5H is the five-hour usage window and Weekly is the weekly window. The 5H row shows the remaining percentage and reset time in 24-hour format. The Weekly row shows the remaining percentage, date, and time. If limit-reset credits are available, their count and expiration dates appear below the Weekly row, one expiration per line. Hover over a usage label to see the used percentage and full reset date. A dash appears when the Codex command is unavailable, the account is not signed in, or usage data cannot be retrieved. This app does not save usage data or credentials in its settings.";
"guide.mechanism.usage-heading" = "Usage Limits\n";
"guide.next" = "Next";
"guide.organize.add-body" = "Repeat the same steps to add any number of accounts. After the existing environment is assigned, that option is disabled and additional accounts use isolated profiles. To use an unregistered profile folder, select ‘Use an Existing Isolated Profile’ on the storage screen.\n\n";
"guide.organize.add-heading" = "Add Another Account\n";
"guide.organize.list-body" = "Rename changes only the display name. Drag a row to change only its position in the list.\n\n";
"guide.organize.list-heading" = "Organize the List\n";
"guide.organize.remove-body" = "Remove on an isolated profile removes only its registration; the profile folder and its data remain. The account assigned to the existing environment cannot be removed.";
"guide.organize.remove-heading" = "Unregister an Isolated Profile\n";
"guide.organize.title" = "Organize Accounts";
"guide.page.accessibility-label" = "Go to page {current} of {total}";
"guide.previous" = "Previous";
"guide.progress" = "Page {current} of {total}";
"guide.register.add-body" = "If the existing environment was not registered automatically, or to add another account, select Add Account and enter a name for the list. You can use a name other than the email address and add any number of accounts. Names must be between 1 and 60 characters and cannot be duplicated.";
"guide.register.add-heading" = "Add an Account\n";
"guide.register.launch-body" = "Launch ChatGPT Profile Manager. If an existing environment is found, the first account is registered automatically using its email address as the display name. Registration alone does not launch ChatGPT; the selected environment launches only when you select Launch in the account list.\n\n";
"guide.register.launch-heading" = "Launch the App\n";
"guide.register.title" = "Register Accounts";
"guide.safety.launch-body" = "When using multiple accounts, launch ChatGPT with Launch in this app instead of the regular ChatGPT icon. Different profiles can run at the same time, while the same profile cannot be launched twice. A running profile is marked Running and its action changes to Quit. Check for work in progress before quitting.\n\n";
"guide.safety.launch-heading" = "Where to Launch ChatGPT\n";
"guide.safety.registration-body" = "If an existing environment is found on first launch, it is registered automatically using the email address as its display name. You can change only the display name later with Rename.\n\n";
"guide.safety.registration-heading" = "Initial Registration\n";
"guide.safety.title" = "Troubleshooting and Safe Use";
"guide.safety.warning-body" = "This is not an official OpenAI feature. Do not use it to circumvent account usage limits.";
"guide.safety.warning-heading" = "Important\n";
"guide.storage.existing-body" = "Use the projects, chats, settings, and login state from the ChatGPT environment you already use. This storage can be assigned to only one account.\n\n";
"guide.storage.existing-heading" = "Use the Existing ChatGPT Environment\n";
"guide.storage.existing-isolated-body" = "Choose and register an existing profile folder. The folder is not copied or moved.";
"guide.storage.existing-isolated-heading" = "Use an Existing Isolated Profile\n";
"guide.storage.introduction" = "After entering a name, the app asks you to choose the storage this account will use. Select one of the following three options.\n\n";
"guide.storage.new-body" = "Create a new storage location dedicated to this account. Data from the existing environment is not copied.\n\n";
"guide.storage.new-heading" = "Create a New Isolated Profile\n";
"guide.storage.title" = "Choose Storage";
"guide.switch.login-body" = "The first time you launch a new isolated profile, sign in to the ChatGPT account you want to use with that storage. Its login state, projects, and chats are saved in the isolated profile. If you selected the existing environment, its current login state is used.\n\n";
"guide.switch.login-heading" = "First Sign-In\n";
"guide.switch.open-body" = "Choose an account and select Launch. ChatGPT starts as a separate instance without quitting profiles that are already running. To protect profile data, the same storage location cannot be launched more than once. For a running profile, Launch changes to Quit. After confirmation, it quits only the ChatGPT instance for that profile.";
"guide.switch.open-heading" = "Launch Profiles in Parallel\n";
"guide.switch.title" = "Sign In and Launch";
"guide.window-title" = "How This App Works";
