"settings-sharing.instructions-explanation" = "AGENTS.md is a Markdown file containing instructions Codex follows while working. Instructions placed in a workspace or project can affect response style, editing rules, and verification steps. When shared, every profile in the group reads the same instructions.";
"settings-sharing.config-explanation" = "config.toml is Codex’s general configuration file for the model, reasoning options, search, and other behavior. It can also contain MCP endpoints, environment variables, HTTP headers, or workspace settings, so it may include account-specific or sensitive values. Live sharing is limited to safe values; for normal copying, review the file contents first.";
